{"sha": "32187fd5bb9f7930adfcb8583a2af02e6320def5978a9658392c88dcafc83839", "body": ["\\begin{method}[主反应方法]\\label{met:b1:predominant-reaction:method}", "求溶液的 pH 与组成：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 列出所引入的物种（包括水），并将其酸碱共轭对", "        置于 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 标度上，酸在一侧，碱在另一侧；", "  \\item 找出存在的最强酸和最强碱；", "  \\item 若两者反应的常数较大（$K > 10^4$，或", "        $\\Delta\\mathrm{p}K_a > 4$），则将该反应视为完全进行，并写出", "        等效溶液；返回第 2 步；", "  \\item 当主反应的常数较小时，它决定溶液", "        的 pH：写出其进度表并解 $Q = K$，通常采用", "        其反应进度较小的假设；", "  \\item 检验假设：次要物种确实很少，并且", "        其他反应（包括水的自耦电离）均可", "        忽略。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,-0.3) -- (0,7.6) node[above] {p$K_a$};", "  \\foreach \\y/\\a/\\b in {0/\\ce{H3O+}/\\ce{H2O}, 1.58/\\ce{HF}/\\ce{F-}, 2.38/\\ce{CH3COOH}/\\ce{CH3COO-},", "      3.62/\\ce{H2PO4-}/\\ce{HPO4^{2-}}, 4.62/\\ce{NH4+}/\\ce{NH3}, 7/\\ce{H2O}/\\ce{OH-}} {", "    \\draw (-0.12,\\y) -- (0.12,\\y);", "    \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.2,\\y) {\\a};", "    \\node[anchor=west] at (0.2,\\y) {\\b};", "  }", "  \\foreach \\y/\\l in {0/0, 1.58/3.16, 2.38/4.76, 3.62/7.21, 4.62/9.25, 7/14} \\node[black!60, anchor=west] at (3.0,\\y) {\\l};", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (-1.6,2.55) -- (1.2,4.45);", "  \\node[omThm, anchor=west, align=left] at (4.2,3.5) {酸与其上方的任一\\\\碱发生反应：$K > 1$};", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (-1.4,7.35) {酸};", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (1.2,7.35) {碱};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 标度（图中 p$K_a$ 向上递增，", "数值标在右侧）。酸易与标度上位于其上方的任一碱发生反应：", "此处为乙酸与氨，", "$K = 10^{9.25 - 4.76} = 10^{4.49}$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[简单溶液的 pH]\\label{prop:b1:predominant-reaction:ph-formulas}", "浓度为 $C$（单位 \\unit{mol/L}），记 $\\mathrm{p}C = -\\log C$：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 强酸：$\\mathrm{pH} = \\mathrm{p}C$，适用于", "        $\\mathrm{pH} < 6.5$；", "  \\item 弱酸，解离很少：$\\mathrm{pH} = \\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_a", "        + \\mathrm{p}C)$，若 $\\mathrm{pH} < \\mathrm{p}K_a - 1$；", "  \\item 弱碱，质子化很少：$\\mathrm{pH} = \\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_e +", "        \\mathrm{p}K_a - \\mathrm{p}C)$，若 $\\mathrm{pH} > \\mathrm{p}K_a +", "        1$；", "  \\item 两性物质，且 $\\mathrm{p}K_{a2} - \\mathrm{p}K_{a1} > 4$：", "        $\\mathrm{pH} = \\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_{a1} + \\mathrm{p}K_{a2})$，", "        无论 $C$ 为何值（若溶液不太稀）。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "强酸：\\ce{HA + H2O -> A- + H3O+} 完全进行，$[\\ce{H3O+}] = C$，", "水自身的贡献（$10^{-7}$）在 $C > 10^{-6.5}$ 时可忽略。", "弱酸：主反应为 $\\mathrm{HA} + \\ce{H2O}", "\\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{A} + \\ce{H3O+}$，反应进度 $x = [\\ce{H3O+}]", "= [\\mathrm{A}]$；若 $x \\ll C$，则 $K_a = x^2/C$，$\\mathrm{pH} = \\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_a", "+ \\mathrm{p}C)$；假设 $[\\mathrm{A}] < [\\mathrm{HA}]/10$", "等价于 $\\mathrm{pH} < \\mathrm{p}K_a - 1$。弱碱的情形与此相同，反应为 $\\mathrm{A} +", "\\ce{H2O} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{HA} + \\ce{OH-}$，常数为 $K_e/K_a$。", "两性物质 HA$^-$：主反应为 $2\\,\\mathrm{HA}^- \\rightleftharpoons", "\\mathrm{H_2A} + \\mathrm{A}^{2-}$，故 $[\\mathrm{H_2A}] = [\\mathrm{A}^{2-}]$；", "将 $K_{a1} = [\\mathrm{HA}^-]h/[\\mathrm{H_2A}]$ 与 $K_{a2} =", "[\\mathrm{A}^{2-}]h/[\\mathrm{HA}^-]$ 相乘，得 $h^2 = K_{a1}K_{a2}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=0.66\\linewidth, height=5.6cm, xmin=0, xmax=8, ymin=0, ymax=8,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$\\mathrm{p}C = -\\log C$}, ylabel={pH},", "  xtick={0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8}, ytick={0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small},", "  legend style={font=\\small, draw=none, at={(0.02,0.98)}, anchor=north west}]", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=pC, y=pH] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-weak-acid-ph.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, dashed] table[x=pC, y=weak] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-weak-acid-ph.dat};", "\\addplot[black!50, dotted, thick] table[x=pC, y=strong] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-weak-acid-ph.dat};", "\\draw[black!30] (axis cs:0,7) -- (axis cs:8,7);", "\\legend{精确, $\\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_a + \\mathrm{p}C)$, $\\mathrm{pH} = \\mathrm{p}C$}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 乙酸溶液的 pH 随 $\\mathrm{p}C$ 变化，", "由电荷平衡精确算得。浓度较高时，酸解离很少，", "遵循 $\\frac12(\\mathrm{p}K_a + \\mathrm{p}C)$；若稀释至", "约 $10^{-6}$ mol/L 以下，则酸完全解离，表现为", "强酸；极稀时，pH 趋于 7。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[乙酸与氨]\\label{ex:b1:predominant-reaction:mixture}", "将 \\qty{0.10}{mol} 乙酸与 \\qty{0.10}{mol} 氨", "在 \\qty{1.0}{L} 中混合。最强酸为 \\ce{CH3COOH}，", "最强碱为 \\ce{NH3}：\\ce{CH3COOH + NH3 <=> CH3COO- + NH4+}，$K = 10^{9.25 - 4.76} =", "10^{4.49}$，该反应为定量反应。等效溶液中", "含 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L} 的 \\ce{CH3COO-} 和 \\ce{NH4+}。", "其主反应 \\ce{NH4+ + CH3COO- <=> NH3 + CH3COOH}，常数较小，", "为 $10^{-4.49}$，并保持 $[\\ce{NH3}] = [\\ce{CH3COOH}]$，于是类似于两性物质，", "$\\mathrm{pH} = \\frac12(4.76 + 9.25) = 7.01$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{多元酸与缓冲溶液}", "", "\\begin{definition}[多元酸]\\label{def:b1:predominant-reaction:polyprotic}", "能依次给出多个质子的酸称为\\emph{多元酸}\\index{多元酸}，", "每一步各有其自身的常数：磷酸 \\ce{H3PO4}", "（$\\mathrm{p}K_a$ = 2.15、7.21、12.34），碳酸", "（\\ce{CO2,H2O}；6.37、10.33），硫酸（一级酸性强，", "二级 1.99）。逐级的 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 依次增大：从一个已带负电的", "物种上移去质子所需代价更大。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}